                        <h5 class="fw-bold font-size-15">How API works?</h5>
                        <p class="text-muted">The API works on HTTP-POST/HTTP-GET METHOD, and the URL to be used is</p>

                        <h5 class="fw-bold font-size-15">Sample URL</h5>
                        <p class="text-muted">
                            Whenever you submit or enquire any request through our API's the system immediately gives you the response in JSON format.
                        </p>

                        <h5 class="fw-bold font-size-15">Sample Response</h5>
