            <div id="complaint_tab" class="tab-pane fade" role="tabpanel">
                <div class="card mt-3">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="font-size-15">Register Complaint API</h5>
                        <hr>
                        <h5 class="font-size-15">API Endpoint</h5>
                        <p><a style="color:blue" class="font">https://domain.com/api/complaint?username=username&amp;token=token&amp;txn_id=our_txn_id&amp;dispute_type=1</a></p>
                        <h5 class="font-size-15">Request Method</h5>
                        <p class="font-size-14 text-muted"><b>GET</b></p>
                        <h5 class="font-size-15">Parameters</h5>
                        <div class="table-responsive">
                            <table class="table table-bordered">
                                <thead>
                                    <tr>
                                        <th>Parameter</th>
                                        <th>Type</th>
                                        <th>Required</th>
                                        <th>Description</th>
                                    </tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody>
                                    <tr><td>username</td><td>string</td><td>Yes</td><td>Username of the API consumer.</td></tr>
                                    <tr><td>token</td><td>string</td><td>Yes</td><td>Authentication token for the API user.</td></tr>
                                    <tr><td>txn_id</td><td>string</td><td>Yes</td><td>The unique transaction ID for which the complaint is being registered.</td></tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td>dispute_type</td>
                                        <td>integer</td>
                                        <td>Yes</td>
                                        <td>
                                            The type of dispute:
                                            <ul class="mb-0">
                                                <li><b>1</b>: Recharge</li>
                                                <li><b>2</b>: Aeps</li>
                                            </ul>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                </tbody>
                            </table>
                        </div>
                        <h5 class="font-size-15">Sample Request</h5>
                        <pre class="bg-light p-3 border rounded"><code>GET https://domain.com/api/complaint?username=username&amp;token=token&amp;txn_id=our_txn_id&amp;dispute_type=1</code></pre>
                        <h5 class="font-size-15">Sample Response</h5>
                        <pre class="bg-light p-3 border rounded"><code>{
    "status": "1",
    "message": "Complaint Registered Successfully.",
    "complaint_no": "7845745"
}</code></pre>
                        <h5 class="font-size-15">Response Parameters</h5>
                        <div class="table-responsive">
                            <table class="table table-bordered">
                                <thead>
                                    <tr>
                                        <th>Parameter</th>
                                        <th>Type</th>
                                        <th>Description</th>
                                    </tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody>
                                    <tr><td>status</td><td>string</td><td>Indicates the success or failure of the request (1 for success).</td></tr>
                                    <tr><td>message</td><td>string</td><td>Descriptive message about the outcome of the request.</td></tr>
                                    <tr><td>complaint_no</td><td>string</td><td>Unique complaint number assigned to the registered complaint.</td></tr>
                                </tbody>
                            </table>
                        </div>
                        <h5 class="font-size-15">Error Handling</h5>
                        <div class="table-responsive">
                            <table class="table table-bordered">
                                <thead>
                                    <tr>
                                        <th>Error Code</th>
                                        <th>Description</th>
                                    </tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody>
                                    <tr><td>400</td><td>Bad request - Missing or invalid parameters.</td></tr>
                                    <tr><td>401</td><td>Unauthorized - Invalid or expired authentication token.</td></tr>
                                    <tr><td>500</td><td>Internal server error - Unable to process the request.</td></tr>
                                </tbody>
                            </table>
                        </div>
                        <h5 class="font-size-15">Notes</h5>
                        <p class="font-size-14 text-muted">Ensure that all required parameters are passed in the request. Use the response <code>complaint_no</code> for future references regarding the complaint.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="callback_info" class="tab-pane fade" role="tabpanel">
                <div class="card mt-3">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="font-size-15">Callback Information</h5>
                        <hr>
                        <h5 class="font-size-15">Method: POST</h5>
                        <p class="font-size-14 text-muted">
                            This document describes the callback mechanism used to notify users of transaction updates. The server sends a POST request to the user's specified URL containing transaction details.
                        </p>
                        <h5 class="font-size-15">Parameters</h5>
                        <div class="table-responsive">
                            <table class="table table-bordered">
                                <thead>
                                    <tr>
                                        <th>Parameter</th>
                                        <th>Type</th>
                                        <th>Description</th>
                                    </tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody>
                                    <tr><td>txnid</td><td>string</td><td>Unique transaction ID generated by the system.</td></tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td>status</td>
                                        <td>integer</td>
                                        <td>
                                            Status of the transaction:
                                            <ul class="mb-0">
                                                <li><b>1</b>: Success</li>
                                                <li><b>2</b>: Failure</li>
                                                <li><b>3</b>: Pending</li>
                                            </ul>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr><td>ErrorMessage</td><td>string</td><td>Descriptive message about the transaction's outcome.</td></tr>
                                    <tr><td>OperatorRef</td><td>string</td><td>Reference ID provided by the operator for the transaction.</td></tr>
                                    <tr><td>ApiTxnId</td><td>string</td><td>Unique transaction ID from the API for reconciliation.</td></tr>
                                </tbody>
                            </table>
                        </div>
                        <h5 class="font-size-15">Headers</h5>
                        <p class="font-size-14 text-muted">Content-Type: <code>application/x-www-form-urlencoded</code></p>
                        <h5 class="font-size-15">Request Example</h5>
                        <pre class="bg-light p-3 border rounded"><code>POST /callback_endpoint HTTP/1.1
Host: userdomain.com
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

txnid=00041248&amp;status=1&amp;ErrorMessage=Recharge%20Success&amp;OperatorRef=MH74154844214&amp;ApiTxnId=090000000423</code></pre>
                        <h5 class="font-size-15">Response</h5>
                        <p class="font-size-14 text-muted">The user's server should respond with a <code>200 OK</code> status code if the callback is successfully received and processed.</p>
                        <h5 class="font-size-15">Error Handling</h5>
                        <div class="table-responsive">
                            <table class="table table-bordered">
                                <thead>
                                    <tr>
                                        <th>Error Code</th>
                                        <th>Description</th>
                                    </tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody>
                                    <tr><td>400</td><td>Bad request - Invalid or missing data.</td></tr>
                                    <tr><td>500</td><td>Internal server error on the user's side.</td></tr>
                                </tbody>
                            </table>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

